            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "hike4diamonds"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely delicious! I had one pound of cheeks so I doubled the sauce. I recommend removing the fish from the pan after searing. Then you can add the sauce to the pan, deglaze and reduce, then add the fish back for the last couple of minutes to finish it. If you leave the fish in the pan during the reducing is going to be overcooked. Thank you for a great recipe!",
            "datePublished": "2018-05-08T04:15:46.410Z"
