              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ccsoen"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Fantastic recipe, this one has become a weekly staple in our home. We get rave reviews whenever we serve it to guests. Works really well with salmon as well. You can marinate and then cook it in the oven also. Thumbs up !!",
            "datePublished": "2015-01-04T01:37:15.977Z"
