              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "whit47"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe was so flavorful, quick, and easy. I made it mostly as written, but with coconut aminos instead of soy sauce and with halibut filets instead of cheeks. I think this recipe would be great with any white fish. I paired with ginger and garlic roasted cauliflower and braised purple cabbage. It made a beautiful plate.",
